<BlogPost
  title="The Instant Gravity Revolution: From Newton's Instantaneous Force to Einstein's Speed Limit"
  description="Explore the groundbreaking discovery that gravity isn't instantaneous. Learn how Einstein revolutionized our understanding of gravity's speed and what it means for the universe."
